# Zero world width: x = y = 0 for everyone, so the grid is a single column of
# 257 cells (zero query radius, so the cell is the 300/256 floor). Distances in
# x and y tie exactly and the k-nearest order between entities at equal z rests
# on ids. grid_ring_knn walks by_xy with lead 0: every step that moves across
# ends its shell at once. Zero-radius queries accept only exact coincidences,
# and query_radius_of must cancel its own hit exactly.
id: r4_zero_width_column
visibility: hidden
track: spatial
